{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HR called, you're FIRED!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suck It Up! is a twin-stick shooter game about sticking it to the man and hurling insults back at your loud coworkers. Explore a series of office floors while completing tasks and eliminating a plethora of working-class enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/copier.gif?t=1744050643\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who're they hiring?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The office floor has a series of employees, each with different and unique attacks. Some projectiles split, some cause explosions, and some will lock in on your location.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sink or Suck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The name of the game is sucking, and that's what you must do. Suck up enemy projectiles with the megaphone to gain different attacks and different ways of clearing the office floor! Low on health? Suck up water at one of the coolers around the map to gain a little boost!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Boss</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat the other office floors to gain entrance to the Boss's office, where you must confront the very person who fired you! Beat different stages of combat to gain the upper hand and cement your place at the very TOP of the corporate ladder.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/bossfight.gif?t=1744050643\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558420?t=1744050643","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558420?t=1744050643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite